		<string text="@9"/>
		<string text="CLASSIC style only. How fast the view turns side to\nside for the mouse's movement."/>
		<string text="CLASSIC style only. How fast the view turns up and\ndown; Same turns it as fast as side to side."/>
		<string text="MCC style only. Halo: MCC's number, for turning and\nlooking up and down alike."/>
		<string text="MCC style only. A scale on the mouse while zoomed,\non top of the weapon's own zoom."/>
		<string text="MCC style only. A scale on the mouse while you are\nin a vehicle's seat."/>
		<string text="Moving the mouse forward looks down."/>
		<string text="Slow and drag the view along with a target while\naiming with the mouse, as with a controller."/>
		<string text="Classic: this port's own sensitivity numbers, the\nrows marked CLASSIC."/>
		<string text="MCC: the sensitivity number matches Halo: The Master\nChief Collection and is within 1% of CS:GO and other\nSource games."/>
